      "message": "I would not expect Replay to play anything on creation. I\u0027d expect it only to play when I ask it to play. Further. Eventually I\u0027d expect to be able to pass some kind of position and effectively say \"play from where you are to \u0027position\u0027\". I had not added a position yet (a function overload to be added later) because we\u0027re not at that point. But just replaying the entire thing in one function doesn\u0027t seem that useful to me.\n\nthoughts?",
